PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: incremental chart drawing.
Why: chart() redrew the whole path (≈ 91 lineTo per series + fill) on every event.
- Integer-pixel step, right-aligned; on exactly one new sample with unchanged size/max/colour the old bitmap is shifted left
  (drawImage 'copy') and only the last 3 steps are redrawn. Same sample twice -> no drawing. Full redraw every 90 samples.
Measured: lineTo per series per sample 92.5 -> 8.5; pixel diff vs a full redraw 0.04 % (89 / 214 489 px).

